site_v2/src/data/fixtures/*.json
# Every fixture an unplayed row of a committed page links to, from one export: every day of the
# Matches page (matches/*.json, the next matchday of every competition), every unplayed Bundesliga
# fixture of competitions/BL1/2026.json's Matchdays tab, and so every Home Next matches row.
# 537 ids, one pattern per run of ids.
# ⛔ Replace, never add. The export emits UPCOMING fixtures only (`status_short in ('NS', 'TBD')
# and fixture_date >= current_date()` in `fetch_fixture_payloads`), so a past id can never be
# re-exported and a stale entry would pin a payload no rerun updates. Refresh the day files, the
# Bundesliga payload, landing.json and this list together, and regenerate the list.
